  characterName: Axion
  dialogues:
  - The final component of the transformer determines the output probabilities for
    the next output TOKEN.
  - It takes the EMBEDDING created by the DECODER and applies a SOFTMAX function
    to scale the EMBEDDING to probabilities.
  - It then chooses the output TOKEN based on those probabilities.
